hashcat-core
============

Copyright (c) 2026 daoge96

This repository contains the core source code of a GPU accelerated password
recovery engine. It is presented here as my own program.

The overall design, the OpenCL compute kernels and large parts of the C engine
are derived from the Hashcat project (https://github.com/hashcat/hashcat),
which is released under the MIT license. Original authorship credits belong to
Jens Steube and the Hashcat contributors.

Files here are provided under the MIT license (see docs/license.txt upstream).
